==Russian==

===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|ru|orv|да}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*da}}.

====Pronunciation 1====
* {{ru-IPA|да́}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-да.ogg}}

====Adverb====
{{ru-adv}}

# [[yes]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Да''', [[я]] [[зна́ю]].|'''Yeah''', I know.}}

=====Antonyms=====
* {{l|ru|нет||no, not}}

=====Descendants=====
* {{desc|en|da|bor=1}}
* {{desc|krl|-|bor=1}}
** North Karelian: {{l|krl|ta}}
** South Karelian: {{l|krl|da}}
* {{desc|kpv|да|bor=1}}
* {{desc|mdf|да|bor=1}}

====Pronunciation 2====
* {{ru-IPA|да́}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-да.ogg}}

====Interjection====
{{head|ru|interjection}}

# [[yes]] ({{n-g|used to confirm that the person being addressed is listening}})
# [[right]], [[isn't it]] ({{n-g|used at the end of an affirmative sentence, turning what was said into a question, asking for confirmation}})
#: {{syn|ru|ве́рно|да ведь|не так ли|пра́вда|пра́вда ведь|так|так ведь}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[ты|Ты]] [[спра́вишься]], '''да'''?|You can handle this, '''right'''?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[он|Он]] [[то́же]] [[там]] [[у́чится]], '''да'''?|He studies there too, '''doesn't he'''?}}
# [[really]] ({{n-g|used to express surprise or ask for confirmation}})
#: {{syn|ru|пра́вда|серьёзно}}
#: {{ux|ru|— [[мы|Мы]] [[с]] [[она|ней]] [[расстаться|расста́лись]] [[уже́]] [[как]] [[ме́сяц]] [[наза́д]].<br />— '''Да'''?|We broke up like a month ago.<br />'''Really'''?}}

====Pronunciation 3====
* {{ru-IPA|да́}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-да.ogg}}

====Noun====
{{ru-noun|да́|n-in|-}}

# a "[[yes]]"
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[бы]] [[сказа́л]] — [[э́то]] [[большо́е]] «'''да'''».|I'd say that's a big "'''yes'''".}}
# an [[affirmation]] in [[support]] of a [[cause]] (as used in slogans or appeals)
#: {{uxi|ru|[[нет|Нет]] [[дискримина́ции]]! '''Да''' [[плюрали́зму]]!|No to discrimination! '''Yes''' to pluralism!}}

====Pronunciation 4====
* {{ru-IPA|də}}
* {{ru-IPA|dɐ}} {{q|before a stressed syllable}}

====Particle====
{{head|ru|particle}}

# [[let]], [[may]] {{+obj|ru|finite&verb}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''да''' [[бу́дет]] [[так]]|[[so be it]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[и|И]] [[сказать|сказа́л]] [[Бог]]: '''да''' [[быть|бу́дет]] [[свет]].|translation=And God said: let there be light.|subst=Бог//Бох}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Да''' [[здравствовать|здра́вствует]] [[респу́блика]]!|translation=Long live the republic!}}

====Pronunciation 5====
* {{ru-IPA|də}}
* {{ru-IPA|dɐ}} {{q|before a stressed syllable}}

====Conjunction====
{{head|ru|conjunction}}

# {{lb|ru|dated}} [[and]]
#: {{ux|ru|[[он|Он]] [[сам]] [[о]] [[себе́]] [[говорить|говори́л]], [[что]] [[ему́]], [[как]] [[император|импера́тору]] Ка́рлу Вели́кому, недосу́г [[учи́ться]] [[чита́ть]] '''да''' [[писа́ть]].|He said of himself that he was like the Emperor Charlemagne, too busy to learn to read '''and''' write.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[ходи́ть]] [[вокруг да около|вокру́г '''да''' о́коло]]|to beat around the bush|lit=to walk around '''and''' about}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[если бы да кабы|е́сли бы '''да''' кабы́]]|[[woulda, coulda, shoulda|should've, would've, could've]] / if only|lit=if only '''and''' if only}}
#* {{quote-book|ru|year=1846|author=w:ru:Фёдор Достоевский<t:{{w|Fyodor Dostoevsky}}>|title=w:ru:[[Бедные люди]]|chapter=s:ru:[[Бедные люди (Достоевский)/Апрель1|Апреля 8.]]|location=|publisher=|newversion=English translation from|translator2=w:Constance Garnett|title2=s:en:[[The Gambler and Other Stories/Poor People|Poor People]]|location2=|publisher2=|year2=1914|page2=|pageurl2=|text=Вообрази́те, приме́рно, дли́нный коридо́р, соверше́нно тёмный и нечи́стый. По пра́вую его́ ру́ку бу́дет глуха́я стена́, а по ле́вую всё две́ри '''да''' две́ри, то́чно нумера́, всё так в ряд простира́ются.|t=Imagine a long passage, absolutely dark and very dirty. On the right hand there is a blank wall, and on the left, doors '''and''' doors, like the rooms in a hotel, in a long row.}}
# [[but]]
#: {{ux|ru|'''Да''' [[граната|грана́ты]] [[у]] [[него́]] [[не]] [[тот|той]] [[система|систе́мы]]!|It's just - his grenades are the wrong caliber! (Quoted from [[w:White Sun of the Desert|White Sun of the Desert]] after antagonist fails to obtain grenades.)}}

=====Usage notes=====
Often used in idioms.

=====Descendants=====
* {{desc|izh|da|bor=1}}
* {{desc|krl|-|bor=1}}
** South Karelian: {{l|krl|da}}
* {{desc|kpv|да|bor=1}}
* {{desc|mdf|да|bor=1}}

====Pronunciation 6====
* {{ru-IPA|də}}
* {{ru-IPA|dɐ}} {{q|before a stressed syllable}}

====Particle====
{{etymid|ru|emphasiser}}
{{head|ru|particle}}

# {{sid|ru|emphasis}} {{n-g|Used as an emphasiser, usually at the start of a sentence or phrase. In many cases, emphasises impatience or irritation, but in others may simply emphasise surprise or an observation.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Да''' [[ты]] [[стал]] [[оптими́стом]].|Well, you've become quite the optimist.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Да''' [[он]] [[рома́нтик]].|I see he's quite the romantic.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Да''' [[что]] [[с]] [[тобо́й]] [[тако́е]]?|What's up with you? (implying something has been visibly wrong for some time)}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Да''' [[как]] [[ты]] [[сме́ешь]]?|How dare you?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''да''' [[ла́дно]] ([[тебе́]]/[[вам]])|[[come on]] / [[give me a break]] / [[really]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[ну]] '''да''' [[ла́дно]]|but okay / but alright / but whatever / anyway}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''да''' [[нет]]|'''oh''', no; nah (a politely emphatic or reassuring no)}}
#: {{ux|ru|— [[ты|Ты]] [[же]] [[замёрзнешь]]! — '''Да''' [[нет]], [[про́сто]] [[нужна́]] [[тёплый|тёплая]] [[оде́жда]].|— You'll freeze! — Nah, I just need warm clothes.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''да''' [[ещё]] ([[и]])|and also / and even}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Да''' [[говорю́]] [[же]] [[тебе́]].|I'm telling you (and have been this whole time).}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Да''' [[пошёл]] [[он]] ([[к]] [[чёрту]]).|'''Oh''' to hell with him.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Да''' [[э́то]] [[же]] Ник [[со́бственной персо́ной]].|Well, if it isn't Nick himself.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Да''' [[кака́я]] [[ра́зница]]?|Who cares? (implying the irrelevance has been obvious for some time)}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[да ну|'''да''' ну]] ([[тебя́]]/[[вас]])|[[yeah, right]] / [[come on]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Да''' [[ра́ди бо́га]].|'''Oh''' for God's sake.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Да''' [[зна́ю]] [[я]], [[в]] [[э́том]] [[и]] [[пробле́ма]]!|I know, that's the problem!}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[это|Э́то]] [[о]] [[чём-то]] [[да]] [[говори́т]].|That says (at least) something.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[всё]] [[для]] [[них]] [[де́лал]], '''да''' [[и]] [[сейча́с]] [[продолжа́ю]] [[де́лать]].|I've been doing everything for them, and '''actually''' still am.}}
# {{n-g|Used as an emphasiser before an imperative verb to express urgency.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Да''' [[переста́нь]], [[ты]] [[меня́]] [[смуща́ешь]].|'''Oh''' stop it, you're embarrassing me.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Да''' [[забу́дь]] [[ты]] [[уже́]] [[об]] [[э́том]].|'''Oh''' forget it already.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Да''' [[заткни́сь]] [[же]] [[ты]] [[наконе́ц]].|Will you [[shut it]] already?}}

====Usage notes====
Can in many cases (but not all) be understood by replacing with "Oh".

====Related terms====
